  "title": "IEEE 802.11: indicate termination for FTM Response",
  "description": "Add (Termination) to the summary when dissecting an FTM Response with\nDialog Token == 0 (which indicates a termination).\n\nExample:\n\n    FTM Request, Trigger=1 (Start or continue sending FTM frames), NTB, Min=0.2s, Max=5s 802.11 43497755 \n    FTM Response, Dialog Token=11, Status=1 (Successful), NTB, Min=0.2s, Max=5s 802.11 43498468 \n    FTM Response, Dialog Token=0 (Termination) 802.11 45511377 0xc7fc",
